
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>R&M Automobile | Fahrzeugbestand</title>

<style>
* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: #f5f5f5;
  color: #222;
}

header {
  background: #111;
  color: white;
  padding: 24px 7%;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 20px;
}

.logo {
  font-size: 29px;
  font-weight: bold;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
}

.logo span {
  color: #c49b55;
}

nav {
  display: flex;
  gap: 25px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

nav a {
  color: white;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-size: 14px;
}

.hero {
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #111, #333);
  color: white;
  padding: 85px 8%;
  text-align: center;
}

.hero h1 {
  font-size: 42px;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}

.hero p {
  color: #ddd;
  font-size: 17px;
}

.hero button {
  margin-top: 28px;
  padding: 15px 30px;
  background: #c49b55;
  color: #111;
  border: none;
  font-weight: bold;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.section {
  padding: 55px 7%;
}

.section h2 {
  font-size: 29px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.intro {
  color: #666;
  margin-bottom: 35px;
}

.categories {
  display: flex;
  gap: 12px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin-bottom: 30px;
}

.category {
  background: #222;
  color: white;
  padding: 12px 20px;
  font-size: 14px;
}

.cars {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
  gap: 25px;
}

.car {
  background: white;
  border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 15px #0000000c;
}

.car img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 210px;
  object-fit: cover;
}

.car-content {
  padding: 20px;
}

.stock {
  color: #a27a35;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: bold;
}

.car h3 {
  margin: 12px 0;
  font-size: 21px;
}

.details {
  color: #666;
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.9;
}

.price {
  font-size: 23px;
  font-weight: bold;
  margin-top: 18px;
}

.contact {
  background: #171717;
  color: white;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 55px 20px;
}

.contact p {
  color: #ccc;
  margin-top: 15px;
}

footer {
  background: #0b0b0b;
  color: #aaa;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 22px;
  font-size: 13px;
}

@media(max-width: 600px) {
  .hero h1 {
    font-size: 30px;
  }

  header {
    justify-content: center;
  }

  nav {
    justify-content: center;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <div class="logo">R&M <span>AUTOMOBILE</span></div>

  <nav>
    <a href="#">Startseite</a>
    <a href="#bestand">Fahrzeuge</a>
    <a href="#kontakt">Kontakt</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <h1>Willkommen bei R&M Automobile</h1>
  <p>Ihr Partner für ausgewählte Automobile.</p>
  <button onclick="document.getElementById('bestand').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">
    FAHRZEUGE ENTDECKEN
  </button>
</section>

<section class="section" id="bestand">
  <h2>Unser Fahrzeugbestand</h2>
  <p class="intro">Entdecken Sie unsere aktuellen Fahrzeugangebote.</p>

  <div class="categories">
    <div class="category">Mercedes-Benz</div>
    <div class="category">BMW</div>
    <div class="category">Audi</div>
    <div class="category">Porsche</div>
    <div class="category">Volkswagen</div>
  </div>

  <div class="cars">

    <article class="car">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618843479313-40f8afb4b4d8?w=800" alt="Mercedes-Benz">
      <div class="car-content">
        <div class="stock">Bestandsnummer: 194</div>
        <h3>Mercedes-Benz C-Klasse</h3>
        <div class="details">
          Erstzulassung: 2023<br>
          Kilometerstand: 24.500 km<br>
          Kraftstoff: Diesel<br>
          Leistung: 200 PS
        </div>
        <div class="price">34.900 €</div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="car">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555215695-3004980ad54e?w=800" alt="BMW">
      <div class="car-content">
        <div class="stock">Bestandsnummer: 195</div>
        <h3>BMW 5er</h3>
        <div class="details">
          Erstzulassung: 2022<br>
          Kilometerstand: 31.000 km<br>
          Kraftstoff: Benzin<br>
          Leistung: 245 PS
        </div>
        <div class="price">39.900 €</div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="car">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1606664515524-ed2f786a0bd6?w=800" alt="Audi">
      <div class="car-content">
        <div class="stock">Bestandsnummer: 196</div>
        <h3>Audi A6</h3>
        <div class="details">
          Erstzulassung: 2023<br>
          Kilometerstand: 19.800 km<br>
          Kraftstoff: Diesel<br>
          Leistung: 204 PS
        </div>
        <div class="price">42.500 €</div>
      </div>
    </article>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="contact" id="kontakt">
  <h2>Kontakt</h2>
  <p>R&M Automobile – Wir freuen uns auf Ihre Anfrage.</p>
</section>

<footer>
  © 2026 R&M Automobile | Alle Rechte vorbehalten
</footer>

</body>
</html>
